+## op_annot::last_warnings -> what the last save_cards could not do, as a list
+## of one-line strings. Empty after a clean walk.
+##
+## ⚠ IT EXISTS BECAUSE SILENT UNDER-EMISSION IS THE FAILURE THAT SURVIVED 85 AND
+## THEN 96 GREEN CHECKS. An alert per cell would be intolerable on a real sheet
+## — mips_cpu/controller alone would fire twice — so the walk counts instead,
+## and write_save_file puts the counts where the user is already looking.
+proc op_annot::last_warnings {} {
+  variable warnings
+  return $warnings
+}
